  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Thinly slice spring onion.<br>• Roughly chop capsicum.<br>• Drain sweetcorn. <br>• Roughly chop coriander. <br>• Finely chop garlic. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cc13d4e23d845507427f/step-a9bdc300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over <br>high heat.<br>• Cook capsicum and corn, tossing, until lightly <br>browned, 4-6 minutes. Transfer to a bowl. </p> <p><br>TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are <br>‘popping’ out! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cc13d4e23d845507427f/step-60206010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Wipe out frying pan, then return to medium-high <br>heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.<br>• When oil is hot, cook gnocchi, tossing occasionally, <br>until golden, 6-8 minutes. </p> <p><br>TIP: Add extra oil if the gnocchi is sticking to the pan!  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cc13d4e23d845507427f/step-6065ea20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat grill to medium-high.<br>• SPICY! This spice blend is hot. Add less if you&#39;re <br>sensitive to heat. To the pan with gnocchi, add <br>Mexican Fiesta spice blend and garlic. Cook, <br>tossing, until fragrant, 1 minute.<br>• Return cooked veggies to the pan, then add the <br>water, brown sugar, butter and passata. Stir to <br>combine, then simmer until slightly thickened,  <br>1-2 minutes. Season to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cc13d4e23d845507427f/step-2cdb9630.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Transfer the saucy gnocchi to a baking dish.<br>• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.<br>• Grill until cheese is melted and golden,  <br>5-10 minutes. </p> <p><br>TIP: Grills cook fast, so keep an eye on the gnocchi! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cc13d4e23d845507427f/step-ad334c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide cheesy Mexican-spiced grilled gnocchi <br>between bowls.<br>• Drizzle with light sour cream (see ingredients). <br>• Sprinkle with pickled jalapeños (if using), coriander <br>and spring onion to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cc13d4e23d845507427f/step-54c13b50.jpg"
    }
  ]
